OL,3,CWoman who neglected 60 dogs and horses
OL,4,Cbanned from owning animals for 7 years
OL,6,FA 75-year-old woman who neglected 27
OL,7,Fhorses and 33 dogs in her care has
OL,8,Fbeen banned from owning animals for 7
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FFollowing an RSPCA investigation, Jean
OL,12,FWinn, of Ramley Road in Pennington
OL,13,Fpleaded guilty to two animal welfare
OL,14,Foffences and was also handed a 12
OL,15,Fmonth community order with a curfew to
OL,16,Fabide by between 9pm and 8am for six
OL,17,Fmonths.
