OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785584876
OL,3,CWoman who neglected 60 dogs and horses
OL,4,Cbanned from owning animals for 7 years
OL,6,FDuring last year's warrant, animals
OL,7,Fwere discovered in unsuitable and
OL,8,Fcramped conditions with various health
OL,9,Fissues.
OL,11,FDogs were found in dirty cages with no
OL,12,Ffood and water throughout rooms at the
OL,13,Fproperty.
OL,15,FHorses were also found in stables and
OL,16,Ffields at the address, with RSPCA
OL,17,Fofficers noting that there was no
OL,18,Fevidence of a food source and no
OL,19,Fevidence that any food had been
OL,20,Fsupplied recently.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
