FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785584876
OL,3,CWoman who neglected 60 dogs and horses
OL,4,Cbanned from owning animals for 7 years
OL,6,FThe ground was heavily poached with
OL,7,Fhazards, with other patches consisting
OL,8,Fof mud and faecal matter.JHorses were
OL,9,Falso removed from two locations in
OL,10,FSway.
OL,12,FThe animals were signed over into the
OL,13,Fcare of the RSPCA for rehoming.
OL,15,FPC Sam Chapman, from Hampshire & Isle
OL,16,Fof Wight Constabulary's Country Watch
OL,17,FRural Crime Task Force said: "I'm
OL,18,Fpleased that our close partners in the
OL,19,FRSPCA have secured this conviction.
OL,26,@yD@^OU
