CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785584876
OL,3,CWoman who neglected 60 dogs and horses
OL,4,Cbanned from owning animals for 7 years
OL,6,F"Police supported the RSPCA with
OL,7,Fwarrants in January 2025 as part of
OL,8,Ftheir investigation, which resulted in
OL,9,Fa large number of animals being
OL,10,Fseized. This is a great example of
OL,11,FRSPCA officers and police working
OL,12,Ftogether to safeguard animals, which
OL,13,Fwere at the very heart of all of our
OL,14,Fhard work.
OL,16,F"I'd like to place on record our huge
OL,17,Fappreciation and thanks for all of
OL,18,Fthose who offered to help, or simply
OL,19,Fcame over to say 'thank you' during
OL,20,Fthe warrants last year."
